# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，检出时由各平台自行决定
# （本模块的文档为中文 Markdown，CRLF 会在网页端渲染出多余空行）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.so   binary
*.a    binary
*.lib  binary
*.pdb  binary

# 文本文件明确标注（便于 GitHub 语言统计与 diff）
*.md   text
*.txt  text
*.json text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.cmake text
CMakeLists.txt text
*.h    text
*.hpp  text
*.cc   text
*.cpp  text
